      "text_preview": "Upon examining the facts and circumstances of the case, this court finds that the preventive detention of the petitioner is without any factual basis and is just based upon ipsi dixit of the SSP Anantnag and the respondent No.3-District Mag"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b05468a7002347fabe5af8ada0d5b934_16",
