      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "If the so called grounds of detention are to be accepted to be making a sense, then surely the petitioner would have suffered implication in some reported incidents endangering the law and order situation lest that of public disorder but wi"
    },
