        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The security of the State of J&K used to be a ground for preventive detention of a person under the Act but ceased to be so w.e.f 31/03/2020 vide S.O.1229(E) of 2020 dated 31/03/2020 whereby it is now only with respect to and by reference t"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f004b2531d54486f9678ba914039be0b_23",
