      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "10. Thus the respondent No. 3-District Magistrate Anantnag was acting without jurisdiction in ordering the preventive detention of the petitioner by reference to \"the Security of the State\" basis."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2963e7be966b444da689b2e3a63ede24_24",
